WEBVTT

00:02:58.307 --> 00:03:01.644
Why is it? Why do we abandon
sleep in our thoughts?

00:03:01.668 --> 00:03:05.571
Well, it's because you don't do anything
much while you're asleep, it seems.

00:03:06.008 --> 00:03:09.012
You don't eat. You don't drink.

00:03:09.513 --> 00:03:10.790
And you don't have sex.

00:03:10.814 --> 00:03:12.218
Well, most of us anyway.

00:03:12.242 --> 00:03:14.046
And so, therefore it's --

00:03:14.070 --> 00:03:15.228
Sorry.

00:03:16.032 --> 00:03:18.268
It's a complete waste of time, right?

00:03:18.292 --> 00:03:19.665
Wrong.

00:03:19.689 --> 00:03:23.488
Actually, sleep is an incredibly
important part of our biology,

00:03:23.512 --> 00:03:26.056
and neuroscientists
are beginning to explain

00:03:26.080 --> 00:03:28.126
why it's so very important.

00:03:28.547 --> 00:03:30.447
So let's move to the brain.